## 1. Problem Statement

Caterpillar Inc. is the world's leading manufacturer of construction and mining equipment, diesel engines, and diesel-electric locomotives, operating across 190+ countries. This model analyzes CAT's FY2024 financial performance (fiscal year ended December 31, 2024) using audited data from the company's 10-K filing with the SEC. FY2023 balance sheet figures serve as prior-year comparators for denominator and average-balance calculations.

The objective is to compute and interpret 30+ ratios across five categories — performance, profitability, efficiency, leverage, and liquidity — to assess value creation, asset efficiency, and financial risk. Results feed directly into the Stage 4 AI-assisted interpretation memo.

