## 5. Calculation Flow

### Derived Inputs

```
market_cap                   = share_price × shares_outstanding
startYear_equity             = BAL_equity_shareholders_2023
startYear_total_assets       = BAL_assets_total_2023
startYear_total_cap          = BAL_debt_long_term_2023 + BAL_equity_shareholders_2023
startYear_inventory          = BAL_inventories_2023
startYear_receivables        = BAL_receivables_2023
currentYear_after_tax_op_inc = INC_net + (1 − tax_rate) × INC_interest_expense
currentYear_daily_sales      = INC_sales / 365
currentYear_daily_cogs       = INC_cost_goods_sold / 365
currentYear_nwc              = BAL_assets_current_2024 − BAL_liabilities_current_2024
currentYear_total_cap        = BAL_debt_long_term_2024 + BAL_equity_shareholders_2024
avg_equity                   = AVERAGE(startYear_equity, BAL_equity_shareholders_2024)
avg_total_assets             = AVERAGE(startYear_total_assets, BAL_assets_total_2024)
avg_total_cap                = AVERAGE(startYear_total_cap, currentYear_total_cap)
```

### Performance

```
MVA = market_cap − BAL_equity_shareholders_2024
M/B = market_cap / BAL_equity_shareholders_2024
EVA = currentYear_after_tax_op_inc − (cost_capital × startYear_total_cap)
```

### Profitability (start-of-year and average-based)

```
ROA = currentYear_after_tax_op_inc / startYear_total_assets   [avg: / avg_total_assets]
ROC = currentYear_after_tax_op_inc / startYear_total_cap      [avg: / avg_total_cap]
ROE = INC_net / startYear_equity                              [avg: / avg_equity]
```

### Efficiency

```
RATIO_asset_turnover          = INC_sales / startYear_total_assets
Receivables turnover          = INC_sales / startYear_receivables
Avg collection period (days)  = startYear_receivables / currentYear_daily_sales
Inventory turnover            = INC_cost_goods_sold / startYear_inventory
Days in inventory             = startYear_inventory / currentYear_daily_cogs
Profit margin                 = INC_net / INC_sales
RATIO_operating_profit_margin = currentYear_after_tax_op_inc / INC_sales
```

### Leverage

```
LT debt ratio         = BAL_debt_long_term_2024 / currentYear_total_cap
LT debt-equity ratio  = BAL_debt_long_term_2024 / BAL_equity_shareholders_2024
Total debt ratio      = BAL_liabilities_total_2024 / BAL_assets_total_2024
Times interest earned = INC_ebit / INC_interest_expense
Cash coverage ratio   = (INC_ebit + INC_depreciation) / INC_interest_expense
RATIO_debt_burden     = INC_net / currentYear_after_tax_op_inc
RATIO_leverage        = BAL_assets_total_2024 / BAL_equity_shareholders_2024
```

### Liquidity

```
NWC to assets = currentYear_nwc / BAL_assets_total_2024
Current ratio = BAL_assets_current_2024 / BAL_liabilities_current_2024
Quick ratio   = (BAL_cash_marketable_securities_2024 + BAL_receivables_2024)
                / BAL_liabilities_current_2024
Cash ratio    = BAL_cash_marketable_securities_2024 / BAL_liabilities_current_2024
```

### Du Pont

```
ROA (Du Pont) = RATIO_asset_turnover × RATIO_operating_profit_margin
ROE (Du Pont) = RATIO_leverage × RATIO_asset_turnover
                × RATIO_operating_profit_margin × RATIO_debt_burden
```

