## 8. Limitations & Next Steps

**Excluded:** Multi-year trend analysis, peer benchmarking (Deere & Co., CNH Industrial), Cat Financial segment-level adjustments, off-balance-sheet capitalization (operating leases, pension), and scenario/sensitivity analysis.

**Stage 4 setup:** Section 5's Calculation Flow becomes the AI prompt instruction block. Section 7's Model Review directs the AI to flag the four assumptions most requiring commentary: WACC sensitivity, capitalization scope, quick ratio composition, and tax rate derivation. Section 6's Outputs define the ratio table the AI will interpret to produce a CFO- and investor-facing narrative on CAT's value creation, operational efficiency, capital structure risk, and liquidity position.

